  "details": "Aside from keeping the greeter, I think that Events should stick to the top of the page.\n\nUser tracked event's should take priority over any featured event (a 2 / 3h before event start feature on the user's page should work nicely), but another event should always be available on the side, as well as a button either mentioning other event's the user has tracked for the next 6h or so, or just a CTA to explore what events are being featured if not, the button taking users into the Calendar.\n\nI'm also bring over the Date from The Calendar, my reasoning for this is basically just, might as well use the space with something relevant, *shrug* \n\nI've Provided a mock image to help illustrate what I want to see as well.",
